# Next 16 prefetches every Link as /<route>/__next._tree.txt, but prune-export
# deletes the segment files to stay under the 20,000 file cap (ADR 0022).
# Answer those requests with a 1 byte file instead of the 36 KB 404 page.
# Routes are at most two segments deep. Cloudflare Pages allows one splat per
# line and no splat mid-path, so use placeholders.
/__next._tree.txt /__prefetch-miss.txt 200
/:a/__next._tree.txt /__prefetch-miss.txt 200
/:a/:b/__next._tree.txt /__prefetch-miss.txt 200
